TI  - The role of botulinum toxin in management of pain: an evidence-based review
T2  - CURRENT OPINION IN ANESTHESIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - botulinum neurotoxins
KW  - pain management
KW  - TENSION-TYPE HEADACHE
KW  - PLACEBO-CONTROLLED MULTICENTER
