TI  - μO-conotoxin MrVIB selectively blocks Na<sub>v</sub>1.8 sensory neuron specific sodium channels and chronic pain behavior without motor deficits
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF SCIENCES OF THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
