TI  - Coenzyme Q10 as a potential add-on treatment for patients suffering from painful diabetic neuropathy: results of a placebo-controlled randomized trial
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF CLINICAL PHARMACOLOGY
LA  - English
