TI  - The Antinociceptive Effect of Milnacipran in the Monosodium Iodoacetate Model of Osteoarthritis Pain and Its Relation to Changes in Descending Inhibition
T2  - JOURNAL OF PHARMACOLOGY AND EXPERIMENTAL THERAPEUTICS
LA  - English
