TI  - Experimental study on the effect of An-pressing and Rou-kneading Huantiao (GB 30) on certain brain nuclei of pleasure circuits in rats with chronic neuralgia
T2  - JOURNAL OF ACUPUNCTURE AND TUINA SCIENCE
