TI  - Activation of the Locus Coeruleus Mediated by Designer Receptor Exclusively Activated by Designer Drug Restores Descending Nociceptive Inhibition after Traumatic Brain Injury in Rats
T2  - JOURNAL OF NEUROTRAUMA
LA  - English
KW  - chronic pain
KW  - DREADDs
KW  - locus coeruleus
