TI  - <i>In vitro</i> and <i>in vivo</i> effects on neural crest stem cell differentiation by conditional activation of Runx1 short isoform and its effect on neuropathic pain behavior
T2  - UPSALA JOURNAL OF MEDICAL SCIENCES
