TI  - Electroacupuncture attenuates bone cancer-induced hyperalgesia and inhibits spinal preprodynorphin expression in a rat model
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF PAIN
LA  - English
KW  - cancer pain
KW  - acupuncture
