TI  - Neutralizing intraspinal nerve growth factor with a trkA-IgG fusion protein blocks the development of autonomic dysreflexia in a clip-compression model of spinal cord injury
T2  - JOURNAL OF NEUROTRAUMA
LA  - English
KW  - cardiovascular control
KW  - cutaneous stimulation
KW  - spinal reflexes
KW  - visceral stimulation
