TI  - TRESK channel contribution to nociceptive sensory neurons excitability: modulation by nerve injury
T2  - MOLECULAR PAIN
LA  - English
KW  - DORSAL-ROOT GANGLION
KW  - AUTOTOMY-INDUCED CHANGES
KW  - HYDROXY-ALPHA-SANSHOOL
KW  - INDUCED PAIN SYNDROME
KW  - HUMAN SKIN
