TI  - Clinical investigation of epalrestat, an aldose reductase inhibitor, on diabetic neuropathy in Japan: Multicenter study (Reprinted from Excerpta Medica International Congress, series 1084, 1995)
T2  - JOURNAL OF DIABETES AND ITS COMPLICATIONS
LA  - English
