TI  - STREPTOZOTOCIN-INDUCED DIABETES IN MICE REDUCES THE NOCICEPTIVE THRESHOLD, AS RECOGNIZED AFTER APPLICATION OF NOXIOUS MECHANICAL STIMULI BUT NOT OF THERMAL STIMULI
