TI  - Expression of Somatostatin Type-2 Receptors in Mouse Dorsal Root Ganglion at Early Stage of Pain Models: Evidence for the Inhibitory Role of Somatostatin in Pain
T2  - PAKISTAN JOURNAL OF ZOOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Somatostatin
