TI  - Lacosamide inhibits calcitonin gene-related peptide production and release at trigeminal level in the rat
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF PAIN
LA  - English
KW  - PAINFUL DIABETIC-NEUROPATHY
KW  - MIGRAINE-LIKE ATTACKS
KW  - STEM IN-VITRO
