TI  - Effects of propofol and dexmedetomidine anesthesia on Th1/Th2 of rat spinal cord injury
T2  - EUROPEAN REVIEW FOR MEDICAL AND PHARMACOLOGICAL SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - Spinal cord injury
KW  - Dexmedetomidine
