TI  - ROLE OF NITRIC-OXIDE IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF THERMAL HYPERESTHESIA INDUCED BY SCIATIC-NERVE CONSTRICTION INJURY IN THE RAT
T2  - ANESTHESIOLOGY
