TI  - Non-invasive neuromodulation using rTMS and the electromagnetic-perceptive gene (EPG) facilitates plasticity after nerve injury
T2  - BRAIN STIMULATION
LA  - English
KW  - TRANSCRANIAL MAGNETIC STIMULATION
KW  - PHANTOM-LIMB PAIN
KW  - CORTICAL REORGANIZATION
