TI  - Activation of the nuclear factor of activated T-cells (NFAT) mediates upregulation of CCR2 chemokine receptors in dorsal root ganglion (DRG) neurons: A possible mechanism for activity-dependent transcription in DRG neurons in association with neuropathic pain
T2  - MOLECULAR AND CELLULAR NEUROSCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - chemokine receptors
