TI  - The anti-inflammatory and analgesic activities of 2Br-Crebanine and Stephanine from Stephania yunnanenses H. S.Lo
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHARMACOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - 10,11-dibrominecrebanine
KW  - stephanine
