TI  - Pregabalin (CI-1008) inhibits the trinitrobenzene sulfonic acid-induced chronic colonic allodynia in the rat
T2  - JOURNAL OF PHARMACOLOGY AND EXPERIMENTAL THERAPEUTICS
LA  - English
KW  - IRRITABLE-BOWEL-SYNDROME
