TI  - The short interference RNA (siRNA) targeting NMUR2 relieves nociception in a bone cancer pain model of rat through PKC-ERK and PI3K-AKT pathways
T2  - BIOCHEMICAL AND BIOPHYSICAL RESEARCH COMMUNICATIONS
