TI  - Spinal Mitogen-Activated Protein Kinase Phosphatase-3 (MKP-3) is Necessary for the Normal Resolution of Mechanical Allodynia in a Mouse Model of Acute Postoperative Pain
T2  - JOURNAL OF NEUROSCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - NEUROPATHIC PAIN
KW  - MAP KINASE
KW  - INFLAMMATORY PAIN
KW  - INCISIONAL PAIN
KW  - RAT MODEL
KW  - MICE
KW  - CONTRIBUTES
KW  - MICROGLIA
