TI  - XP13512 [(±)-1-([(α-isobutanoyloxyethoxy)carbonyl] aminomethyl)-1-cyclohexane acetic acid], a novel gabapentin prodrug:: II.: Improved oral bioavailability, dose proportionality, and colonic absorption compared with gabapentin in rats and monkeys
