TI  - Effect of Ethyl Acetate Extract of <i>Ferula asafoetida</i> Oleo-Gum Resin on the Glucose Level and Lipid Profile in Streptozotocin-Induced Diabetic Rats
T2  - JUNDISHAPUR JOURNAL OF NATURAL PHARMACEUTICAL PRODUCTS
