TI  - Mechanisms of imidazoline I<sub>2</sub> receptor agonist-induced antinociception in rats: involvement of monoaminergic neurotransmission
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF PHARMACOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - PAIN
KW  - LIGANDS
KW  - INHIBITION
KW  - OXIDASE
